  m_Name: Step_20_InstallSharedPrinter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScreenshotStepData
  stepId: Step_20_InstallSharedPrinter
  instructionText: 'LO1.1 - Back to the server. Publish the printer so clients can
    install it by name.


    Start > Devices and Printers. Select the printer, open
    Printer properties, and go to the SHARING tab.


    Share it, and list it in
    the directory. Sharing puts it on the network; listing is what lets a domain
    client find it.'
  assessmentPrompt: Share and publish printer
